# `yo --help` must name EVERY subcommand `main` dispatches: check, cache,
# explain, lsp, unsafe-report and public-safe-report were missing for months
# while their `yo <sub> --help` texts existed. The first line carries the
# version, so the golden keeps only the `yo <subcommand>` lines.
stdout_keep=^(\$ yo |rc=|yo )
